      cap: `<path d="M${f1(cx - hw - 2)} ${t + 12} q${f1(hw + 2)} -26 ${f1(2 * hw + 4)} 0 z" fill="${c2}" ${S}/><path d="M${f1(cx + hw - 2)} ${t + 10} q10 -2 16 3 q-8 3 -16 1 z" fill="${c2}" ${S}/>`,
